
  <sn><md>### Impacts of Arsenic and Lead

**Arsenic (As)** and **lead (Pb)** are toxic **heavy metals/metalloids** that can persist in the environment and cause serious effects on humans, animals, plants, soil, and aquatic ecosystems.

